{"name": "Punctual Monsters", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plan then Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every monster sleeps with an alarm clock, and the number printed on it is the moment it wakes. Drop a few monsters onto the board, choose their numbers, then press run and watch the whole board count down from 5 to 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Plan then run\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/42a0c00328c9b6464860fd280c88b0d7.poster.avif?t=1789335389\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/42a0c00328c9b6464860fd280c88b0d7.webm?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/42a0c00328c9b6464860fd280c88b0d7.mp4?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Satisfy All Kinds Of Requirements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some boards want a box on a plate. Others need a bullet on target, or a beam held in exactly the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"satisfy requirements\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/05846e6264a93cc220f2ced8d56ef696.poster.avif?t=1789335389\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/05846e6264a93cc220f2ced8d56ef696.webm?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/05846e6264a93cc220f2ced8d56ef696.mp4?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Monsters Are Movable As Well</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boxes are not the only things that move. Push a monster before it wakes and it acts from its new position - or bend its beam with a mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"movable monsters\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/861ec6b4c55eb188127ce5dd66301105.poster.avif?t=1789335389\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/861ec6b4c55eb188127ce5dd66301105.webm?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/861ec6b4c55eb188127ce5dd66301105.mp4?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make It Explode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crash two bullets together at exactly the right place and time. The blast breaks walls, shoves whatever stands nearby, and opens a route that was not there before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Make it explode\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/fa1681225f4f1a01314f0101bf225dcd.poster.avif?t=1789335389\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/fa1681225f4f1a01314f0101bf225dcd.webm?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/fa1681225f4f1a01314f0101bf225dcd.mp4?t=1789335389\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras_big/67ee76b1fab046c5421055d64f1ed860.avif?t=1789335389\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/extras/67ee76b1fab046c5421055d64f1ed860.avif?t=1789335389\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A cute puzzle game about sleepy monsters and their alarm clocks. Every monster wakes up on its own number. Place your monsters and get everyone up on time.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5103420/e98ad40e42e792a9bb93246fba20c3a57cf5a09b/header.jpg?t=1789335389", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Casual", "Puzzle", "2D", "Cozy", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Lemoning", "publishers": "Lemoning", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5103420", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pzbGaB-Qa1w", "first_seen": 1789250400.0, "review_rank": 69}